      "text": "Our town is the busiest in the morning. By 4:00 a.m., the bread is baked by the bakers. At 5:00 a.m., the newspapers are delivered by eight children on bikes. At 6:00 a.m., the buses are driven by the school bus drivers. By 7:00 a.m., some children are walking to school. The school bell is rung at 8:00 a.m. each morning, and the children go to their first class. From 6:00 a.m. to 8:00 a.m., some cars are driven by people on their way to work, but many others ride the bus or work from home. Everyone gets an early start each day. No wonder it's quiet by 10:00 p.m. in our town. Morning schedule. Time.",
